{"id":"f68edd91fed9964b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal.md","title":"ZFC Filter Selective Coideal","display":"df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal — ZFC Filter Selective Coideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal"],"display":"df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal — ZFC Filter Selective Coideal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal — ZFC Filter Selective Coideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7dc7e5f969b3e8a\" href=\"?note=e7dc7e5f969b3e8a\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,\\vec A,B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal H,\\vec A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S\\)</span> (coideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7dc7e5f969b3e8a\" href=\"?note=e7dc7e5f969b3e8a\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typed function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveCoideal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveCoideal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}selective\\text{-}coideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveCoideal}_S(\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S(\\omega,\\mathcal H)\\land\n\\forall\\vec A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\to\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall n\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(B\\setminus(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}selective\\text{-}coideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveCoideal}_S(\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S(\\omega,\\mathcal H)\\land\n\\forall\\vec A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\to\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall n\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(B\\setminus(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Selectivity is the diagonalization property for decreasing sequences in a coideal; the upstream predicate supplies the coideal axioms on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7dc7e5f969b3e8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7dc7e5f969b3e8a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S$ (coideal predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (typed function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H,\\vec A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveCoideal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}selective\\text{-}coideal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterSelectiveCoideal}_S(\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S(\\omega,\\mathcal H)\\land\n\\forall\\vec A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n))\\\\\n&\\hspace{42mm}\\to\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall n\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(B\\setminus(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1884","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal.md|58-df-zfc-filter-selective-coideal]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e7dc7e5f969b3e8a","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb"]}